    "notes": "Directed deck centerline from four mapped cutwaters; origin fitted to official IGN RGE ALTI upper road plateaus 35.4/35.6 m, cross-checked against BD TOPO 3D road axes. Model reference water 28.5 m differs from sampled RGE water 28.05 m; river level is not a fixed structural datum. The exact curved deck/wing polygon removes only covered, successfully loaded bridge-road fragments. Connector stations at native X +/-99.25 m approximate the asymmetric road ends -101.9/+96.6 m by 2.65 m, inside the full-width blending radius; the resulting native profile difference is below 5 cm. Endpoint heights retain the actual authored road elevations. Host terrain must use NGF-IGN69 or explicitly convert heights. Current terrain captures remain required."
  },
